parameters.text:
=Generate the content using the following confirmed client requirements.

Topic: {{ $json.output.topic }}

Goal: {{ $json.output.goal }}

Language: {{ $json.output.language }}

Target Audience: {{ $json.output.target_audience }}

Follow all instructions in your system prompt. Generate the complete SEO-friendly blog post and the Instagram, Facebook, and LinkedIn content. Return the final result for human review. Do not publish anything.

